    "text": "Hints: $\\frac{\\cos ^2 x-\\sin ^2 x}{\\sin x \\cos x} \\times \\frac{\\sin 2 x}{\\cos 2 x}=\\frac{2 \\cos 2 x}{\\sin 2 x} \\times \\frac{\\sin 2 x}{\\cos 2 x}=2$"
